Windows: the previous root cause was real but incomplete

Step conclusions for job 111036711922:

    1 | Set up job | success
    2 | Run actions/checkout@v4 | success
    3 | Parse the PowerShell installers | failure
    4 | Install protoc | skipped
    5 | Read pinned toolchain | skipped
